      "content": "i get that, but i really dont want to deal with the clinic today lol. it's just a number right? i looked up vitamin K supplements online and they say they can help stabilize it. if i just take a high dose of a vitamin k supplement like 10mg or something, wouldn't that basically cancel out the extra blood thinner so i can just wait until my next appointment? i feel like i can manage this myself if i know the right amount to take.",
